<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">EHOKORA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ehokora ya Johani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ehokora</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eho</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ehokora</para>
  <para style="mt2">ya Johani</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Eyi po ehokora ya Yesu Krisitu, eyi a mu pire Nyambi ci a monithse angambenthzi eyi i na roera ku tendahara popano. Wa tumine kangeru kenthzi kwa ngamba wenthzi Johani ku na mu dimukithsa eyi enu. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Aye wa tongorire yoihe eyi a monine. Ou odiyo muthzimbu wenthzi o diywi dya Nyambi nombangi wa Yesu Krisitu. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Wa thsiyauthzi o ku varera aa maywi ou ukethzi ku mbunga, karo akwa thsiyauthzi wahe awa a teerera no ku hengeka eyi i na ñoriwamo, inene thsikati pepi thsi di.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Johani aa vumenena makereke o mutanu na edi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Edi diñoro dyaa tunda ku kwange, ame no Johani, naa ñorera amwe mwa makereke o mutanu na edi aa a di mu Asia:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Thsihemo no thsiyaro ikare nenu ku tunderera kwa Nyambi oyu diko, oyu wekarako, karo oyu keya, no ku mipepo thzo mutanu na thzidi ethzi thzi di pa rupara ro ngunja thzenthzi.<verse eid="REV 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />Karo mu piwe thsihemo no thsiyaro ku tunderera kwa Yesu Krisitu, aye mbangi o ku rurama, aye mwedi ku kupinduka kwafu, karo yodiyo muendithsi o mafumu o kaye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Wa ku tu shima, karo naa tu rukurura kwivi yetu ko ku viithsa onyinga wenthzi. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Naa tu kwama mbunga thzo mapurisita ku kwamena Nyambi Tata wenthzi. Kutethzima nokoro ikare kwa Yesu diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Mu mone! Aa keya pa mavui.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">Munu yomuhe kenge a ku mu mona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">mane nowa na mu kiñi kenge a ku mu mona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">Mishovo thzothzihe thzo mu kaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">kenge thza ku dira mukaci kenthzi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 1:7">Ii, kenge ya kwikara kengeyo! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Fumu Nyambi aa amba ci: “Yame no Alufa no Omega,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alufa po taku thzo kutanga mu Thsigerike, Omega po thzodiyo thzo mahurerero.</char></note> Matatekero no Mamaneneno. Yame oyu diko, oyu wekarako, karo oyu keya, aye Shokoro Ouhe.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Johani aa mona Yesu Krisitu mu thsimona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Yame no Johani, mwapenu mu thsitawo, karo muenthzenu mu makando no mu Kutumina kwa Nyambi no mu kucitanarithsa oku a twithsera Yesu. Shime nekarire muya mu diongo di nethsiwa Patimosi mukaci ko ku amba diywi dya Nyambi nombangi wa Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mu diyuwa dya Fumu, nekarire mu Mupepo wa Nyambi, amepo ni yuva diywi dyodikuru munyima thzange eci torombita. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Dya ambire ci: “O ñore mu vuka eyi o mona no ku thzi tumena ku makereke o mutanu na edi aa a di mu mambongi a Efese, Simirina, Perigamo, Tiyatira, Saride, Filadelufia no mu Laodisea.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Na cithsetukire ci ni mone oyu wa ambire nange. Ou na cithsetukire na monine imeko yo tumbarambara yo gauda yo mutanu na idi, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />karo mu kaci ko imeko yo tumbarambara mwekarire oyu wa monaharire eci Mwana Munu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref>.</char></note> o ku na vata thsikoveyo thsothsire shime ku ka kuma kwidyato yenthzi, karo wa ciangire mwiya o gauda mu muidi. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Huki thzo ku mutwi wenthzi nedi thzikenu too eci mbwe, meho enthzi nedi eci mirengi. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Edyato yenthzi ya monaharire eci kopa oyu yekema mu dirungu. Diywi dyenthzi dya yuvaharire eci meyu oangi aa a pupa.<verse eid="REV 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Wa kwatererire matungwethzi o mutanu na edi mu dyoko dyenthzi dyo rudyo, mu kanwa kenthzi kwa tundire mwere outwe nokunoku. Rupara rwenthzi rwa monaharire eci diyuwa mutenya o ku u twa.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ou na mu monine na wererire ku mauru enthzi eci thsithzimbi. Ngou a ni kambekire dyoko dyenthzi dyo rudyo no ku amba ci: “Wa yapa! Yame o Kutanga no Mahurerero. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Yame oyu Yoya. Shime naa fa, uno honi naa yoya diyere na diyere! Yame ni di no mapao o Kufa no Ndau Thzafu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dihere. Mu Thsigerike po Hadesi.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Mweyo, o ñore eyi o na mono, eyi i tendahara pano neyi i keya munyima thzeyi. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Diano dyoa matungwethzi o mutanu na edi aa o na mono mu dyoko dyange dyo rudyo, neyi imeko yo mutanu na idi yo tumbarambara yo gauda po eyi: Matungwethzi o mutanu na edi po ya emanena tungeru to makereke o mutanu na edi, imeko yo tumbarambara yo mutanu na idi po ao makereke o mutanu na edi.” <figure style="fig" file="WA04002b.tif" size="col" loc="Rev 1:20" copy="Wade" ref="1.20">Imeko yo tumbarambara</figure><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Efese</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Efese ci: ‘Aa odiyo maywi aa a tunda koyu na kwaterera matungwethzi o mutanu na edi mu dyoko dyenthzi dyo rudyo no ku endaura mu kaci ko imeko yo tumbarambara yo mutanu na idi yo gauda.<verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka etenda yoe no kukwama nene koe, no muooto woe. Ni na dimuka ci tumba o thsierera anu owamango, karo no ereka awa cithsa ci tunganda, unone ya tumbako. No wana ci a angera. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />No ootera no ku citanarithsa mu makando mukaci ko dithzina dyange, unone ko no aya.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />“ ‘Uno honi ko i di eyi ni ku shomorora: No thsii thsishimo thsiya wekarire nathso pa kutanga. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />O vuruke ore opa no u! O cere no ku kwama eyi no kwamanga pa kutanga. Ngeci ko cera, kenge na ku keya ku koe no ku na tundithsa thsimeko thsoe thso kambarambara mu dyango dyathso. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Uno honi eyi yodiyo ni ku shangara: Waa thzimba etenda yo Manikolai eci ame edi na i thzimba.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke!’ O ku othza, kenge na ku mu pa ku ima yo thsitondo thso mwoyo ethsi thsi di mu paradaisi thza Nyambi.”<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Simirina</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Simirina ci: ‘Aa maywi aa a tunda koyu o Kutanga no Mamaneneno, oyu wa fire, unone aa yoya karo.<verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka makando oe nohepwe woe, unone o fumanyi! Ni na dimuka kwipithsa amweya mathzina kowa a amba ci Majuda, unone kadi Majuda shemwa, awo po thsiciwano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po sinagoge.</char></note> pohuma thsa Satana. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Wa yapa makando aa o tamba ku nyanda. Naa ku tongwera ci shamaonga kenge a ku mi ereka ko ku paka amweya ku kwenu mu kamenga. Kenge mwa ku nyanda mayuwa o dikumi, uno honi wa ku rurame kate ko ku kufa, apo honi kenge na ku ku pa ao mushukwe o mwoyo.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke!’ O ku othza ka a ku kururiwa ku kufa ko muthsidi.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Perigamo</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Perigamo kenge ci: ‘Aa odiyo maywi oyu di no mwere o wenge nokunoku.<verse eid="REV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka ci waa tunga mu mbongi omu thzi di ngunja thza Satana, unone no rurama ku kwange. Ko no hamura thsitawo thsoe ku kwange shaanga mu mayuwa a Antipasi, aye mbangi wange o ku rurama oyu wa paiwerire mu kaci kenu omo mu mbongi a na yoyo Satana.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />“ ‘Uno honi ko i di yoipu eyi ni ku shomorora: Shimbi ekarerako oko awa shupwera erongithsa ya Balaami,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:5">Muta 22.5</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 25:1-3">25.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 31:16">31.16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:4">Mura 23.4</ref>.</char></note> oyu wa rongithsire Balaki ku teera thsiraha Maisiraele ci a tende thsivi ko ku dya edya yo ku tupwera ekupuro, mofoci kengeyo no ruthziho. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Karo o di no wa shupwera erongithsa yo Manikolai. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Mweyo, o cere! Ngeci ko tende kengeyo, popano naa keya ku koe no ku na wa rwithsa no mwere ou u tunda mu kanwa kange.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke!’ O ku othza kenge na ku mu pa ku maana aa na a horekiwa. Karo kenge na ku mu pa diwe dyodikenu edi di di no dithzina dyodipe edi di na ñoriwapo, edi a kana ku dimuka munu shime aye wa ku di tambura.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Tiyatira</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Tiyatira ci: ‘Aa odiyo maywi a Mwana Nyambi, aye mukwa meho o kuninga eci mirengi, nedyato yo ku dyekema eci kopa oyu di mu mudiro oyu na kenithsiwa.<verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka etenda yoe yoihe, thsishimo thsoe, no thsitawo thsoe, ekwama yoe no kucitanarithsa koe. Karo naa mona ci waa tenda nawa mweyi enu eyi kupita pa kutanga.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />“ ‘Uno honi ko i di eyi ni ku shomorora: Waa thsierera oya mbuyama Jezebele oyu na cithsanga ci mukwakukethza. Mwirongithsa yenthzi aa pambanithsa apikange ku wa twara mu ruthziho no ku dya edya yo ku tupwera ekupuro. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Na ni mu pa ndau thzo ku cera evi yenthzi, unone ka a fotire ku thsia ruthziho rwenthzi. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Mweyo, kenge na ku mu kuhera podidi o makando, apa a ku nyandera nene shemwa, aye nowa naa rembeka nenthzi, shime ngeci wa ku cere no ku thsia etenda yo yoimango. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Kenge na kwipaa anenthzi. Apo honi makereke oahe kenge a ku dimuka ci yame oyu na fotithsithsanga nawa eanekera nefota yo munu no munu. Kenge na ku pa munu no munu ku kwenu ethsi thsi na mu roera kokuthza ketenda yenthzi.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“ ‘Unone naa ambera amwe mwahe mwamweya mu Tiyatira, awa a na kana ku shupwera eyi erongithsa yo mbango karo ka na cirongithsa eyi ethsa amweya ci “Diano dyoshokuru dya Satana,” ka ni rundekire pa mupango wenu. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Shaanga kengeyo, mu tanarithse pohuma eyi mu di nayo shime ku ka kuma apa na ku keyera. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />O ku othza no ku kwama eshima yange shime ku ka kuma ku hura, kenge na ku mu pa okoro peuru thzo matunga. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Kenge a ku a tumina ko muramu o thsifu, no ku ororora eci kafuma koma, eci dyodi na tamburire okoro kwa Tata. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Karo kenge na ku mu pa Dirungwe.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke.’ ” <figure style="fig" file="GPS_Seven Churches Plain BW_No marginMS.tif" size="col" ref="2.29" /><verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Saride</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Saride ci: ‘Aa o maywi aa a tunda koyu na kwaterera mipepo thzo mutanu na thzidi thza Nyambi no matungwethzi o mutanu na edi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“ ‘Ni na dimuka etenda yoe, karo ni na dimuka ci o na pupaana ci waa yoya, unone o mukwa kufa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />O kothsoroke! O tanarithse eyi o na thsiara nayo, eyi i di po pepi no ku fa, inene ni na wana ci etenda yoe ka i kwanenenine pa meho a Nyambi wange. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Mweyo, o vuruke eyi wa tamburire neyi wa yuvire. O i hengeke no ku cera. Ngeci ko kothsoroka, kenge na ku keya ku koe ko thsiundumukera eci mwithzi.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />“ ‘Uno honi kwa di owapu omo mu kereke thza Saride awa a na kana ku yarithsa evata yo dithziro. Awo kenge a ku enda nange o kwa na vata yoikenu, inene aa roera kwikara kengeyo. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />O ku othza eci awo kenge a ku yengiwa yoikenu, karo mbera ka ni tundithsa dithzina dyenthzi mu Vuka thzo Mwoyo, unone kenge na ku pa ombangi o dithzina dyenthzi pa meho a Tata no tungeru twenthzi.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke!’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Filadelufia</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Filadelufia ci: ‘Aa odiyo maywi oyu o mukenu noshemwa, oyu na kwaterera dipao dya Fumu Davida. Ethsi a na yanthzurura kwithsa o ku thsi yanthzera, karo ethsi a na yanthzera kwithsa o ku thsi yanthzurura.<verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka etenda yoe yoihe. O mone, ni na ku yanthzurwera thsero thzo kuninga ci kwithsa o ku twethsa ku thzi yanthzera. Ni na dimuka ci o di nokoro oupu pohuma, unone no tanarithsa diywi dyange karo ko no ni hamura. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />O teerere! Kenge na ku reta waya akwa thsiciwano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po sinagoge.</char></note> thsa Satana, awa cithsa ci Majuda, shaanga ci kadi Majuda shemwa, unone akwakwangera. Kenge na ku wa tenda ci a ku keye no ku na tongama ku mauru oe, wangu a ku dimuke ci yowe na shima. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Pakuninga ci no hengeka eraa yange yo kucitanarithsa, kenge na ku ku nyunga mu thsikati thseereka eyi i tamba ku keya mu kaye kokahe ku na ereka anu wahe o kaye.<verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />“ ‘Popano naa keya. O tanarithse ethsi o di nathso ci kwa kwikara oyu wa ku ku nyanga mushukwe woe. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />O ku othza kenge na ku mu tenda diunthzi mu tembere thza Nyambi wange karo mbera ka a tundumo. Kenge na ku ñora pa penthzi dithzina dya Nyambi wange no dithzina dyo thsikuña thsa Nyambi wange, aye Yerusalema omupe, oyu tunderera ku wiru kwa Nyambi wange, kenge na ku ñora karo pa penthzi dithzina dyange dyodipe.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eyi ya ñoriwerire kereke thza Laodisea</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“O ñorere kangeru ko kereke thza Laodisea ci: ‘Aa maywi aa tunda kwa Ameni, mbangi o ku rurama no shemwa, aye matatekero enu yoihe eyi ombire Nyambi.<verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“ ‘Ni na dimuka ekwama yoe yoihe, ni na dimuka ci ko womborire, karo ko pire. Naa cikumbwethza ci nga wa ombora nji kupya. <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Uno honi pakuninga ci waekara dienyemvu, ko womborire, karo ko pire, kenge ni ku shanja mu kanwa kange! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Waa amba ci: “No fumanyi, ni di neyi ni na foto yoihe, kwithsa ethsi ni na nyanda.” Unone ko dimukire ci o mukwakucithzekera, o munu o makando, o hepwe mane o kapuputwa karo thsisheshe o di. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Naa ku thsiurura ci o ure ku kwange gauda oyu na kenithsiwa mu mudiro, ci o fume. O ure karo ku kwange evata yoikenu yo ku vata, ci nga o thsike honyi thzo thsisheshe thsoe. Karo o ure ku kwange muthzi o meho, ci o wethse pa meho oe ci o twethse ku mona.<verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />“ ‘Ame naa kutururanga no ku orora awa na shima. Mweyo, o pakereko maano o cere evi yoe. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />O mone! Ni nemana pa thsero no ku ngongomona. Ngeci munu aa yuva diywi dyange no ku yanthzurura thsikwaro, kenge ningena no ku dya nenthzi, karo naye kenge a dya nange.<verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />“ ‘O ku othza kenge na ku mu pa ku roera kwikara nange pa ngunja thzange, eci ame edi na ni othzo no kwikara na Tata pa ngunja thzenthzi.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“ ‘Oyu di no matwi, a yuve eyi u amba Mupepo ku makereke.’ ”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Thsimona thso ngunja mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Munyima thzeyi, na kengire, ngou na monine thsero o ku thzi na yanthzuruka mu wiru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Diya diywi na yuvire pa kutanga eci torombita o ku di amba nange dya ambire ci: “O kambame o keye kuno kenge na ni ku monithsa eyi i na roera ku tendahara munyima thzeyi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Popo nekarire mu Mupepo wa Nyambi, ngou na monine ngunja mu wiru apa kwekarire munu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Oyu wekarirepo wa rwethzimine eci mawe oakuru mu thsivaka aa a nethsiwa jasipere no karinea. Dikongoro dya thzingurukire ethzo ngunja edi dya monaharire eci diwe edi di nethsiwa emaraludi. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Mangunja o makumi edi na ane apa pekarire akuru o makumi edi nane a thzingurukire ethzo ngunja. A vatire evata yoikenu, karo a vatire mishukwe thzo gauda ku mitwi thzo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Oko ku ngunja kwa tundire kwethsa ko mvura no mivumo thzo mishika. Pa rupara rwethzo ngunja kwekarire mimunyi thzo mutanu na thzidi o ku thzi yuuma. Ethzi thzo mipepo mutanu na thzidi thza Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Karo pa rupara rwethzo ngunja kwekarire ethsi thsa monaharire eci diwate dyo thsiponi, edi dya rwethzimine eci kirisitale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Mu kaci kethzo ngunja no ku thzinguruka ngunja kwekarire yumbiwa ine yoiyumi, eyi ya yarire meho perama ku rupara no ku manyima<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:5-14">Ezek 1.5-14</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 1:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:4">10.4</ref>.</char></note>. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Thsumbiwa thsothsiyumi thso kutanga thsa monaharire eci nyime, thso muthsidi thsa monaharire eci pohoana, thso muthsihatu thsekarire no rupara eci ro munu, thso muthsine thsa monaharire eci ngonga oyu unduka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Thsumbiwa no thsumbiwa kweyo yumbiwa ine yoiyumi thsekarire no mando o mutanu na dyofoci, aa ekarire no meho oangi peuru no mushi. Ka ya thsiire ku amba othsiku no mutenya ci,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“O mukenu, o mukenu, o mukenu,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Fumu Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">Oyu wekarako, oyu diko, karo oyu keya.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Thsikati no thsikati eyo yumbiwa yoiyumi o ku i yemekera no ku remeka, ku kanderera koyu di pa ngunja, aye oyu yoya diyere na diyere, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />awo akuru o makumi edi nane aa tongamena oyu nekara pa ngunja, no ku rombera aye oyu yoya diyere na diyere. Aa kuhera mishukwe thzo pa rupara ro ngunja no ku amba ci,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Fumu wetu no Nyambi wetu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Waa roera ku piwa kutethzima, no direma, nokoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Inene wombire enu yoihe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">keshima yoe ko i di, karo yombiwire.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Vuka no Dinguana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Ngou na monine vuka mu dyoko dyo rudyo dyoyu wekarire pa ngunja. Ethzi vuka shime thza ñoriwire mu kaci no peuru, thza angiwire nene keramatera yo mutanu na idi.<figure style="fig" alt="Scroll with seals" file="gt00149.tif" size="col" loc="Rev 5:1-5" copy="Gordon" ref="5.1-5">Thsifundo neramatera</figure><verse eid="REV 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Ngou na monine kangeru kokakoro o ku ka kuerera ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Edye o ku roera ku ramutura eramatera no ku thsikura ethzi vuka?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Unone kwithsa mu wiru nji mu kaye nji kushi thzo kaye oyu wa twethsire ku thsikura ethzo vuka no ku mona eyi ya ñoriwiremo. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ngou na dirire nene, inene ka kwa waniwire oyu wa roerire ku thsikura ethzo vuka no ku monamo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Yumweya wakuru wa ni amberire ci: “Wa dira! O mone, oya Nyime o mu mukuta wa Juda, mwanahoka shokuru wa Fumu Davida na a othzo akwethzimbo yenthzi. Aa twethsa ku thsikura ethzo vuka no ku ramutura eyo eramatera yo mutanu na idi.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ngou na monine Dinguana edi dya monaharire eci shime dyaa fa, uno honi dyaa yoya. Shime dyemanine pa rupara ro ngunja o ku di na thzingurukiwa ku yumbiwa ine yoiyumi nakuru o makumi edi nane. Edyo Dinguana dyekarire no manyia o mutanu na edi no meho o mutanu na edi, athzo mipepo thza Nyambi thzo mutanu na thzidi ethzi thza tumiwire mu kaye kokahe.<verse eid="REV 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Diya Dinguana ngou dya thzire no ku ka shimba vuka mu dyoko dyo rudyo dyoyu wekarire pa ngunja. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ou dya manine ku thzi shimba, yumbiwa ine yoiyumi nakuru o makumi edi nane a tongamine pa meho a Dinguana. Munu no munu kukwo wa kwatererire harepa no karonga kokathzungi ko gauda ko kuyara insense, ayo erombero yanua Nyambi.<verse eid="REV 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Ngou embire dimbo dyodipe ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Waa roera ku shimba vuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">no ku ramutura eramatera yathzo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">inene shime wa epaiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">karo konyinga woe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">no patwera Nyambi anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ku tunderera mu mishovo thzothzihe, mu manjimi oahe, mu mambunga oahe, no mu matunga oahe.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />No wa tende mafumu no mapurisita,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">awa kwamena Nyambi wetu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">karo kenge a ku tumina mu kaye.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Na kengire karo, amepo ni yuva maywi o tungeru totungi, to ku kwana tukore to makumi na makumi, otu twa thzingurukire ngunja, no yumbiwa yoiyumi nakuru.<verse eid="REV 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ko diywi dyodikuru twa ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Dinguana edi dyepaiwire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">dyaa roera ku piwa ofumu no rufumo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">onyanyami, okoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">direma, kutethzima no kushangara!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ngou na yuvire yumbiwa yoihe eyi i di mu diwiru, eyi i di mu kaye, eyi i di kushi thzo kaye, neyi i di mu diwate o ku i amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Koyu di pa ngunja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">noku kwa Dinguana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">kwikare kushangariwa, direma, kutethzima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">nokoro diyere na diyere!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Yumbiwa ine yoiyumi ya tawire ci: “Ameni!” Akuru ngou a tongamine ku yemekera.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Eramatera yo mutanu na idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ngou na kengire, na monine Dinguana o ku di ramutura thso kutanga kwiramatera yo mutanu na idi. Ngou na yuvire thsimweya ku yumbiwa ine yoiyumi o ku thsi amba ko diywi eci mushika ci: “O keye!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Na kengire, ngou na monine kakambe kokakenu. Oyu wa pahamine po wa kwatererire ota o mandamba. Wa piwire mushukwe, ayepo thza eci mukwakuothza ku ka othza.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ngou karo a ramuturire thsiramatera thso muthsidi, karo na yuvire thsumbiwa thsothsiyumi thso muthsidi o ku thsi amba ci: “O keye!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Ngou kwa punine kakambe kamweya kokakihu pyu eci mudiro. Oyu wa pahaminepo wa piwire okoro o ku tundithsa thsiyaro mu kaye ci anu a cipaapae. Ngou a piwire mwere oukuru.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Dinguana ngou a ramuturire thsiramatera thso muthsihatu, na yuvire thsumbiwa thsothsiyumi thso muthsihatu o ku thsi amba ci: “O keye!” Ngou na kengire amepo ni mona kakambe kokeru. Oyu wa pahaminepo wa kwatererire thsipimithso mu dyoko dyenthzi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Na yuvire ethsi thsa vumine eci diywi edi dya tundererire ku yumbiwa ine yoiyumi ku amba ci: “Kiro thzofoci thzo vuroto thzaa uriwa ko madi o ku kwamena diyuwa dyofoci, makiro ahatu o mahangu aa uriwa ko madi o kukwamena diyuwa dyofoci. Uno honi wepithsa maathzi o muywera no waine.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Dinguana ou a ramuturire thsiramatera thso muthsine, na yuvire thsumbiwa thso muthsine o ku thsi amba ci: “O keye!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Na kengire no ku mona kakambe kokukwayuka. Oyu wa pahamine po dithzina dyenthzi nedi Kufa, karo Ndau Thzafu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po Hadesi.</char></note> thza mu shupwerire munyima. A piwire okoro peuru thzo thsipinthzi thso muthsine thso kaye, kwipaa ko mwere, ndombo, ekora nekondwama yo mu kaye.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Dinguana ou a ramuturire thsiramatera thso muthsitanu, na monine kushi thzo katara myoyo thzowa a paiwire mukaci ko diywi dya Nyambi nombangi wo o shemwa. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />A kuererire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Fumu Shokoro Ouhe, shokenu noshemwa, kenge ya kwikara thsikati thso kukuma kupi ci o rature no ku pa humbithso anu o kaye mukaci konyinga wetu?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ngou a piwire munu no munu thsikoveyo thsothsikenu. Karo a amberiwire ci a turumwithse thsikati thsothsire ko, shime ku ka kuma apa thza ku kwanena taro thzaenthzo apika Nyambi awa kwipaiwa eci awo.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Na kengire karo, ngou na monine Dinguana o ku ramutura thsiramatera thso muthsitanu na thsofoci. Kwekarire kungangama ko kaye kokukuru, no diyuwa dyeraurire eci thsito thsothsiru, karo ngonda thza kihire eci onyinga. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Matungwethzi a kurumukire ku wiru ku wera mu kaye eci ñuyu ethzi thzi shime ku kora, ethzi thzi kurumuka kukuyu ou u nyungiwa ku mupepo. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Diwiru dya pwire eci thsifundo thso ku fundiwa, mikinya thzothzihe no maongo oahe a tutururiwire mu mandau ayo.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ngou mafumu o kaye, akwakutumina naendithsi o mamvo, afumanyi, owakoro, apika nakwakurukuruka a ka cihorekire mu mahorongo no mu mawe o mu mikinya. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />A amberire mikinya no mawe ci: “Mu tu were, mu tu horeke ku rupara royu nekara pa ngunja no kuanthzi wa Dinguana! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Inene diyuwa dyoshokuru dyoanthzi wo di na kumu, edye nga o wimanena?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Anu o 144,000 awa a pakire Nyambi etamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Munyima thzeyo, na monine tungeru tune o ku tu nemana mu mambango ane o kaye, o ku tu na ñaña mipepo thzine thzo kaye ku yapithsa ci kwa pepa mupepo pa kaye nji pa diwate nji pa thsitondo thsipi nji thsipi. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ngou na monine kangeru kamweya o ku ka tunda ku muvo o ku ka na shimbi thsiramatera thsa Nyambi oyu yoya. Kethsire ko diywi dyodikuru tuya tungeru tune otu twa piwire okoro o kwipithsa kaye no diwate. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Ka ambire ci: “Mwepithsa kaye, nji diwate, nji etondo, shime o ku tu na mana ku paka etamba pa rupara rwapika Nyambi wetu.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ngou na yuvire taro thzowa a pakiwire etamba ya Nyambi, a kwanine 144,000 ku tunderera mu mikuta thzothzihe thza Isiraele.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Mu mukuta wa Juda nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Rubeni nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Gadi nedi 12,000, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Mu mukuta wa Asere nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Nafetali nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Manase nedi 12,000, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />mu mukuta wa Simioni nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Livi nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Isakare nedi 12,000, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />mu mukuta wa Zabuloni nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Josefa nedi 12,000, mu mukuta wa Benjamini nedi 12,000.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mungi oukuru wanu ku tunderera mu kaye kokahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Munyima thzeyi, na kengire no ku mona mungi wanu oukuru o kukana ku twethsa munu ku tara awa tundererire mu matunga oahe, mu mishovo thzothzihe, mu mambunga oahe, no mu manjimi oahe. Emanine pa rupara ro ngunja no pa rupara rwa Dinguana. A vatire evata yoikenu, karo a kwatererire mite thzo makaka mu moko o. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />A kuererire ko diywi dyodikuru ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Kuyoyithsiwa kwetu kwaa tunda kwa Nyambi oyu nekara pa ngunja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:10">karo kwaa tunda kwa Dinguana.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Tungeru totuhe twemanine ku thzinguruka ngunja nakuru no yumbiwa ine yoiyumi. A wire pashi ku furumana pa rupara ro ngunja no ku yemekera Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />A ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Ameni! Kushangara no kutethzima nonyanyami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">nokanderero no direma nofumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">nokoro ikare kwa Nyambi wetu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:12">diyere na diyere. Ameni!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Yumweya kwakuru wa ni purire ci: “Adye awo anu a na vata yoikenu, karo aa tunda kupi?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Na mu tawire ci: “Ñathsire wange, yowe o na dimuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Wa ni amberire ci: “Awa wodiyo na tundu mu dikarara dyoshokuru, na yoo evata yo no ku i kenithsa munyinga wa Dinguana.<verse eid="REV 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />“Mweyo, a nemana pa rupara ro ngunja thza Nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">no ku mu kwamena mu Tembere thzenthzi mutenya nothsiku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">Oyu nekara pa ngunja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">kenge a ku tunga peuru thzo.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Mbera ka fu karo nthzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">karo mbera ka fu dinotwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Diyuwa mbera ka di wa tumeka karo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">nji ku tumekiwa ku ngara kupya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Isa 49.10</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Inene oyu Dinguana oyu di pa kaci ko ngunja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">kenge mba ekara Mudithsani wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">Kenge mba a wa tangerera ku manowa o meyu o mwoyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">karo Nyambi kenge mba a porora mihothzi thzothzihe ku meho o.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Dinguana aa ramutura thsiramatera thso muthsitanu na idi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Dinguana ou a ramuturire thsiramatera thso muthsitanu na idi apo pa vuka, kwekarire kututwara mu diwiru thsikati thso ku fota ku kwana kaci ko thsitunde.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ngou na monine tungeru to mutanu na twidi otu tu nemananga pa rupara rwa Nyambi. Twa piwire matorombita o mutanu na edi.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Kangeru kamweya aka ka shimbire thsitumekerero thso gauda thso insense ka keyire no ku nemana pa katara. Ka piwire insense o mungi ku pakerera nerombero yakwakutawa wahe ci ka i kumithse pa katara ko gauda aka ka di pa rupara ro ngunja. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Mwithse o insense ku pakerera kengeyo nerombero yakwakutawa ya thzire mu wiru kwa Nyambi ku tunda mu dyoko dyo kangeru. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Kangeru ngou ka shimbire thsitumekerero thso insense no ku thsi yarithsa mudiro o pa katara no ku thsi kuhera pa kaye. Kwekarire kwethsa ko mvura no mishika, mivumo no kungangama ko kaye.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matorombita o mutanu na edi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Oto tungeru to mutanu na twidi otu twa kwatererire matorombita o mutanu na edi ngou twa ciroithserire ku a shika.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Kangeru ko kutanga ka shikire torombita thzako. Mbwe no mudiro eyi ya cipakererire nonyinga ya kuheriwire pa kaye. Rwavu ro muthsihatu ro kaye rwa pire, rwavu ro muthsihatu rwetondo rwa pire, karo no muhonyi ouhe ouyu wa pire.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Kangeru ko muthsidi ka shikire torombita thzako. Thsinu ethsi thsa monaharire eci mukinya oukuru, ethsi thsa yuumine eci mudiro thsa kuheriwire mu diwate. Rwavu ro muthsihatu ro meyu o mu diwate rwa pirukire onyinga, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />rwavu ro muthsihatu ro yumbiwa yoiyumi yo mu diwate ya fire, karo rwavu ro muthsihatu ro mangunde rwepithsiwire.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Kangeru ko muthsihatu ka shikire torombita thzako. Ditungwethzi dyodikuru edi dya yuumine eci mumunyi dya wire ku wiru, dya wererire rwavu ro muthsihatu ro marware no manowa o meyu. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Dithzina dyedyo ditungwethzi po Oruru. Rwavu ro muthsihatu ro meyu a rurire, nanu owangi a fire mukaci ko meyu ku rura.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Kangeru ko muthsine ka shikire torombita thzako, rwavu ro muthsihatu ro diyuwa rwa furiwire, mofoci kengeyo no rwavu ro muthsihatu ro ngonda no rwavu ro muthsihatu ro matungwethzi, ci rwavu ro muthsihatu rwayo rwiraure. Rwavu ro muthsihatu ro mutenya ka kwekarire mwethzi, mofoci kengeyo no rwavu ro muthsihatu ro othsiku.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Na kengire karo, ngou na yuvire ngonga oyu wa thzire ndongoro mu wiru o ku na rende oyu wa kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Mayuwane, mayuwane, mayuwane othsimo wanu o kaye wahe, mukaci ko mivumo thzo matorombita aa a tamba ku shikiwa ku tungeru tumweya tuhatu!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu ka shikire torombita thzako. Ngou na monine ditungwethzi edi dya wererire pa kaye ku tunda ku wiru. Edyo ditungwethzi dya piwire dipao dyo ku dikwina dyo kupira ondanda. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Edyo ditungwethzi ou dya vukurire ku dikwina, mwa tundire mwithse eci mwithse o ku tunda mu dirungu dyodikuru. Diyuwa no diwiru yeraurithsiwire ku mwithse ou wa tundire omo mu dikwina.<figure style="fig" alt="Trumpet being blown" file="gt00125b.tif" size="col" loc="Rev 9:1-2" copy="Gordon" ref="9.1-2">Torombita thzaa shikiwa</figure><verse eid="REV 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Omo mu mwithse mwa tundire dimba ku keya pa kaye, karo dya piwire okoro o kuninga eci o nge. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Dya amberiwire ci dyepithsa muhonyi o pa kaye, nji emena, nji ngara thsitondo, shime anu pohuma awa pirire thsitamba thsa Nyambi pa rupara. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Edyo dimba ka dya tawethziwire kwipaa awo anu, unone dya tawethzewire pohuma ku wa nyandithsa mu maonda o mutanu. Kukora kwadyo kwaa cipitura eci nge o ku na humu munu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mwao maonda o mutanu anu kenge a ku fotafota kufa, unone ka ku ku wana, kenge a ku fota ci nga a fe, unone kufa kenge kwa ku wa cira.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Edyo dimba dya monaharire eci tukambe otu tu na roithsiwera mvo. Dyekarire neyi ya monaharire eci mishukwe thzo gauda ku mitwi thzadyo, karo rupara rwadyo rwa piturire eci munu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Ohunga wadyo eci huki thzo mbuyama, maeo adyo eci o nyime. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Pa miidi thzadyo dyekarire necandekithso eyi ya cipiturire eci ecandekithso yo thsifu yo pa muidi. Muvumo o mando adyo wa yuvaharire eci muvumo o matemba no tukambe totungi eyi i cirera ku mvo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Dyekarire no mithsira no mamonya eci nge. Karo mu mithsira thzadyo dyekarire nokoro o ku kurura anu mu maonda mutanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Dyekarire no fumu oyu wa di endithsire, oyu fumu po nedi kaya kangeru ka tundire omo mu dikwina dyo kupira ondanda. Dithzina dyako mu Thsiheveru po “Abadoni,” mu Thsigerike po “Apolioni.” Edi dithzina dyaa amba ci “Mukwakwipithsa.”<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Dikarara dyo kutanga di na piti, ku na thsiarera makarara edi.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu na kofoci ka shikire torombita thzako. Na yuvire diywi edi dya tundire ku manyia ane o katara ko gauda aka ka di pa rupara rwa Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Dya amberire kangeru ko muthsitanu na kofoci aka ka kwatererire torombita ci: “O puture tungeru tune otu tu nangiwa ku Rware roshokuru rwa Yuferati.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Tungeru tune otu twa roithsiwerire ethsi thsikati nedi diyuwa nethzi ngonda nou mwaka, ngou twa puturiwire kwipaa rwavu ro muthsihatu rwanu wahe mu kaye. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Na yuvire taro thzo mashwarare aa a pahamine apo pa tukambe, nedi 200 milioni (200,000,000).<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Mu thsimona thsange na monine otu tukambe nowa a pahaminepo. Awa pahaminepo shime a vatire pa miidi ecandekithso yoikihu eci mudiro no muvara o nthziru nou o kavava eci sulufura. Mitwi thzoto tukambe thza piturire eci mutwi o nyime, mu tunwa twato mwa tundire mudiro, mwithse no sulufura. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Rwavu ro muthsihatu rwanu rwa paiwire kwao makarara ahatu o mudiro, mwithse no sulufura eyi ya tundire mu tunwa to tukambe. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Okoro oto tukambe wekarire mu tunwa twato no mu mithsira thzato, inene mithsira thzato thza piturire eci mayoka, karo thzekarire no mitwi ethzi thzekarire nokoro o ku kurura anu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Unone anu wahe a wa kanine kwipaiwa koa makarara ka cerire ekwama yo moko o. Ka thsiire ku rombera mathzimu, ekupuro yo kumba pa gauda, pa silivera, pa kopa, pa mawe no petondo, anyambi o kukana ku twethsa ku yuva nji ku mona nji ku enda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Awo anu awo karo ka cerire kwipaa kwo nji orothzi wo nji ruthziho rwo nji withzi wo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kangeru no kavukaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ngou na monine kangeru kamweya koka koro o ku ka tunda ku wiru. Shime ka vatire divui no dikongoro peuru thzo mutwi wako. Rupara rwako rwethsire eci diyuwa, mauru ako a monaharire eci maunthzi o mudiro. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Ka kwatererire kavukaana mu dyoko o ku ka na thsikuka. Thsidyato thsako thso rudyo thsa dyatererire pa diwate, thso rumoho thsa dyatererire pa kaye. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Ngou ka kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru eci kuvuruma ko nyime. Ou ka kumbire, kwa yuvaharire mishika thzo mutanu na thzidi o ku thzi tawa. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Popa thza ambire ethzo mishika thzo mutanu na thzidi, amepo ni fota ku ñora, unone na yuvire diywi edi dya ambire ku wiru ci: “Eyi thzi na amba mishika thzo mutanu na thzidi po ikare diano, wa i ñora!”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Kaya kangeru na monine o ku ka nemana pa diwate no pa kaye ngou ka yerwerire dyoko dyo rudyo mu wiru. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Kethzire ngoro ko dithzina dyoyu yoya diyere na diyere, oyu wombire diwiru neyi i dimo yoihe, kaye neyi i dimo yoihe, no diwate neyi i dimo yoihe. Kaya kangeru ka ambire ci: “Kwithsa karo ku thzihama! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Uno honi mu mayuwa aa ka ku shika kangeru ko muthsitanu na twidi torombita thzako, diano dya Nyambi kenge dya ku maneneniwa eci dyodi a i hongire kapikenthzi akwakukethza.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ngou na yuvire diya diywi dya tundire ku wiru, dya ambire karo nange ci: “O thze o ka shimbe kaya kavukaana ka na thsikuriwa, kaya ka di mu dyoko dyo kangeru kaya ka nemana pa diwate no pa kaye.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ngou na thzire ko kaya kangeru no ku ka ka romba ci ka ni pe ako kavukaana. Ka ambire ci: “O ka shimbe o ka dye. Kenge ka wawata mu dira dyoe, unone mu kanwa koe kenge ka towara eci oki.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8-3:3">Ezek 2.8—3.3</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Ngou na shimbire ako kavukaana mu dyoko dyo kaya kangeru no ku ka dya. Ka towarire eci oki mu kanwa kange, unone ou na ka minine ka wawatire mu dira dyange. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ngou ka ni amberire ci: “Waa roera kukethza karo ku mambunga oangi, matunga no mishovo no mafumu.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Mambangi edi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ngou na piwire dimbungu dyo ku anekethzithsa dyo kupitura eci muramu no ku amberiwa ci: “O thze o ka anekethze Tembere thza Nyambi no katara, karo o ka tare akwakurombera awa a dimo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40-42">Ezek 40—42</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Uno honi wa ka anekethza dirapa dyo pora thzo Tembere. Wa ka di anekethza, inene di na piwa kwAnukenge, kenge a ku dyatadyata thsikuña thso shokenu thsa Yerusalema maonda o makumi ane na edi. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Kenge na ku pa okoro ku mambangi ange edi aa a ku vata mathsaka. Kenge a ku kethza mwao mayuwa o 1,260.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Aa mambangi edi po etondo yo miywera idi no imeko yo tumbarambara idi eyi i nemana pa rupara rwa Fumu o kaye.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:1-14">Zak 4.1-14</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Ngeci munu ayepo fota ku kurura aa mambangi edi, mudiro waa tunda mu tunwa twao mambangi no ku ñotora akwethzimbo yo. Edi dya na roera ku fa wahe awa na foto ku wepithsa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Awo a di nokoro o ku yanthzera diwiru ci mvura a roka mu thsikati ethsi a ku kethza. Karo a di nokoro o ku pirura marware no mawate onyinga, nokoro o ku fura kaye ko makarara oahe ko thsikati thsothsihe ethsi a na shimi.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ao mambangi ou a ku mana ku pa ombangi wo, thsikondwama thso mu dikwina dyo kupira ondanda kenge thsa ku keya ku na wa rwithsa no ku wa othza no ku wepaa. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Ethzimbi yo kenge ya kwikara pa mbanthza thzo thsikuña thsoshokuru omu ambiwerire Fumu wo pa mbinda. Ethso thsikuña aa thsi tendanga mathsierekethzi ci Sodoma na Egepita. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Mu mayuwa ahatu no kaci ko diyuwa mambunga oahe, mishovo thzothzihe, no manjimi oahe no matunga oahe kenge a ku kenga ethzimbi yo no ku kana ku wa vumbeka. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Anu o kaye kenge a ku nyanyukera kufa kowa akwakukethza aidi, no ku kwama thsidika apa a ku cipera ekunda, inene awa akwakukethza aidi na nyandithsa nene anu o kaye.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Unone munyima thzo mayuwa ahatu no kaci ko diyuwa, Nyambi wa wa puyerire mwoyo awopo emana kedyato yo, wahe awa a wa monine a yapire nene. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Awo akwakukethza aidi ngou a yuvire diywi dyodikuru ku tunderera ku wiru o ku di wa ambera ci: “Mu keye kuno.” Ngou a thzinine mu wiru mu divui, akwethzimbo yo o kwa na tanekera.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Kethsiya thsikati kwekarire kungangama kokukuru ko kaye, thso mudikumi ku thsikuña thsa wire. Tukore to mutanu na twidi twanu a fire oko ku kungangama ko kaye. Awa a parire a yapire nene no ku shangara okuru wa Nyambi o ku wiru.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Dikarara dyo muthsidi di na piti, dyo muthsihatu dyaa keya popano.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Torombita thzo muthsitanu na edi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu na twidi ka shikire torombita thzako. Kwekarire maywi oakuru aa a kuererire mu wiru ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Kutumina ko kaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">ku nekara honi kutumina kwa Fumu wetu na Krisitu wenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">karo kenge a ku tumina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">diyere na diyere!”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ngou akuru o makumi edi nane awa ekarire pa mangunja a furumanine ku rombera Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />A ambire ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Fumu Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">oyu diko, karo oyu wekarako!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Twaa kanderera ku koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">inene o na shimbi okoro woe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">karo o na tateka ku tumina!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Matunga a anthzipire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">unone thsikati thsoanthzi woe thsi na kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">thsikati thsi na kumu thso ku ratura afu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">no ku pa miyambo kwapikoe akwakukethza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nanuoe owakenu wahe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">owakuru mu thsivaka nowa owaonye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">akwakutawa wahe awa na yapa dithzina dyoe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Thsikati thsi na kumu thso ku thzirithsa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">awa epithsa kaye!”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Tembere thza Nyambi thzo mu wiru thza yanthzururiwire, pongithsi thzo thsiyuvano thza monaharire mu Tembere thzenthzi. Kwekarire kwethsa ko mvura, mivumo, mishika no kungangama ko kaye no mbwe thzothzikuru.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mbuyama no mbarange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ngou kwa monaharire thsimonithso thsothsikuru mu wiru, thso mbuyama oyu wa vatire diyuwa, no ngonda kushi thzedyato yenthzi no mushukwe o matungwethzi o dikumi na edi ku mutwi wenthzi. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Shime ekarire poremu, wa dirire ko diywi dyodikuru mukaci ko kukora ko kunyatithsa.<figure style="fig" alt="Woman and the seven headed dragon" file="gt00152.tif" size="col" loc="Rev 12:1-4" copy="Gordon" ref="12.1-4">Mbuyama no mbarange o mitwi thzo mutanu na thzidi</figure><verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Kwa monaharire karo thsimonithso thsimweya mu wiru, mbarange o mukuru o mukihu o mitwi thzo mutanu na thzidi no manyia o dikumi no mishukwe thzo mutanu na thzidi ku mitwi thzenthzi. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Muthsira wenthzi wa kokire rwavu ro muthsihatu ro matungwethzi o ku wiru no ku a kuhera pa kaye. Oya mbarange ngou emanine pa rupara royo mbuyama wekarire po pepi no ku shamuruka ci a dye kambu kenthzi popa ka shamurukiwa. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Wa shamurukire kambu kokakwerume oyu mbo tumina matunga oahe no muramu o thsifu. Unone oyo kambu wa comboriwire no ku twariwa kwa Nyambi no ku ngunja thzenthzi. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Oyo mbuyama wa cirerire mu dikunguthsitu oku a mu roithserire ndau Nyambi ku ka mu nyungerako mu mayuwa o 1,260.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvo mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Ngou kwa katukire mvo mu wiru. Mikaele no tungeru twenthzi a rwithsire oyo mbarange. Naye mbarange no tungeru twenthzi a ciamwenine ko ku rwa. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Unone mbarange wa othziwire omo mu mvo, aye no tungeru twenthzi kekarire karo no ndau mu wiru. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Oyo mbarange shokuru wa kuheriwire pashi, adyo diyoka dyo kare edi di nethsiwa shamaonga nji ci Satana, oyu na angera kaye kokahe. Wa kuheriwire pa kaye mofoci kengeyo no tungeru twenthzi.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ngou na yuvire diywi dyodikuru mu wiru o ku di amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Kuyoyithsiwa, nokoro nofumu wa Nyambi wetu i na kumu honi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">Krisitu na monithsa okoro wenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">inene mukwakuthzekithsa aenthzetu akwakutawa na kuheriwa pa kaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">oyu na wa thzekithsa mutenya nothsiku pa meho a Nyambi.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Na mu othzo konyinga wa Dinguana nombangi wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">Ka shimine nene myoyo thzo mane shaanga ku twara ku kufa.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Mweyo, mu roere amwe mwa mawiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">namwe mwa tungamo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Unone mwakwothsimo amwe mwa kaye no diwate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">inene shamaonga na keye pashi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">koanthzi oukuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">inene na dimuka ci thsikati thsenthzi thsipu.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Oyo mbarange ou a monine ci na kuheriwa pa kaye, wa cithzacithzire oya mbuyama wa shamurukire kambu kokakwerume. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Uno honi oya mbuyama wa piwire mando edi o ngonga o mukuru ci a unduke ku thza ku ndau ethzi a roithsiwerire mu dikunguthsitu, oku a ku ka nyungiwera mu myaka thzihatu no kaci ko mwaka ci a pare kwedyo diyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Diya diyoka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbarange.</char></note> dya ndanyunine meyu mu kanwa kadyo eci rware munyima thzoyo mbuyama ci ru mu pukithse. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Unone kaye ka kwathsire oya mbuyama, ka yanthzururire kanwa kako no ku mina rware oru rwa tundire mu kanwa koya mbarange. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Oya mbarange ngou a anthziperire oyo mbuyama, wa ka rwithsire anahokenthzi wahe awa thsiarirepo, awa a hengeka eraerera ya Nyambi no ku rurama mumbangi wo keyi ya Yesu [Krisitu].<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Oyo mbarange ngou emanine pa dikambo dyo diwate.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mañoro amweya o ñanyiñanyi aa amba ci “Nemanine pa dikamba dyo diwate.”</char></note><verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Thsikondwama ethsi thsombokire mu diwate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ngou na monine thsikondwama o ku thsiomboka mu diwate. Thsekarire no manyia o dikumi no mitwi thzo mutanu na thzidi, no mishukwe thzo dikumi ku manyia athso. Pa mutwi no mutwi wathso pa ñoriwire mathzina o ku yengwera Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Ethso thsikondwama na monine thsa cipiturire no nthzoo, edyato yathso ya piturire yo bere, kanwa kathso eci ko nyime. Oya mbarange wa pire ethso thsikondwama okoro wenthzi no ngunja thzenthzi nofumu wenthzi oshokuru. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Umweya ku mitwi thzathso wa monaharire eci shime waa kuruka nene shime ku fota ku fa, unone ethso thsitwa thsothsikuru nene thsa porire. Kaye kokahe ka komokire no ku shupwera ethso thsikondwama. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Anu a romberire oya mbarange pakuninga ci wa pire okoro ko thsiya thsikondwama, karo a romberire thsikondwama no kwipura ci: “Edye o ku cishoka nethsi thsikondwama? Edye o ku twethsa ku thsi rwithsa?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Ethso thsikondwama thsa tawethziwire ku amba maywi o ku cishangara no ku yengwera Nyambi. Thsa piwire okoro o ku kwama mu maonda o makumi ane na edi. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Thsa ambire maywi oamango nene o ku yengwera Nyambi no dithzina dyenthzi no ndau omu a tunga, mofoci kengeyo nowa tunga mu wiru. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Ethso thsikondwama thsa tawethziwire ku rwithsa akwakutawa no ku wa othza. Karo thsa piwire okoro o ku tumina mishovo, mambunga, manjimi no matunga yoihe. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Anu wahe o kaye kenge a ku rombera ethso thsikondwama, awa kana ku ñoriwa mathzina o mu vuka thzo mwoyo thza Dinguana oyu wa paiwire ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Oyu di no matwi a yuve.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Yomuhe oyu na roera ku kupariwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kenge a ku kupariwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">yomuhe oyu na roera ku paiwa ko mwere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">kenge a ku paiwa ko mwere.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Eyi yaa monithsa ci anua Nyambi aa roera ku citanarithsa no ku rurama.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsikondwama ethsi thsa vumbukire mu muve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ngou na monine thsikondwama thsimweya o ku thsi vumbuka mu muve. Thsekarire no manyia edi eci dinguana, unone thsa ambire eci mbarange. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Thsa kwamithsire okoro ouhe o thsiya thsikondwama thso kutanga. Thsa ooterire kaye kokahe nowa ekaramo ku rombera thsiya thsikondwama thso kutanga, thsiya thsekarire no thsitwa ethsi thsa porire. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Thsa kwamine emonithso yoikuru yo kukomokithsa, kuninga ci mane shime thsaa reta mudiro pashi ku tunda ku wiru o kwa na cimonena anu. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Mukaci keyo emonithso, thsa tawethziwire ku kwama mu dithzina dyo thsikondwama thso kutanga, thsangerire anu o kaye. Thsa wa tuminine kumba thsikupuro ku remeka thsiya thsikondwama thsa kururiwire ku mwere, unone thsaa yoya. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Thsiya thsikondwama thso muthsidi ngou thsa tawethziwire ku puyera mwoyo mu thsikupuro thso thsikondwama thso kutanga ci thsi twethse ku amba no kwipaa wahe awa a kanine ku thsi rombera. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ethso thsikondwama karo thsaa ooterire anu wahe, owaonye nowa owakuru, afumanyi nahepwe, akwakurukuruka napika, ci a tambure thsitamba pa dyoko dyo rudyo nji pa rupara. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kwithsa oyu wa tawethziwire ku ura nji ku urithsa ngara thsinu ko kupira ethso thsitamba thsethso thsikondwama, adyo dithzina dyathso nji nomboro thzo dithzina dyathso.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Eyi yaa roera ci munu ekare nonyanyami. Oyu di no mathsaano a tongonone eyi thzi nemanena ethzo nomboro thzo thsikondwama, inene thza emanena nomboro thzo munu. Nomboro thzathso po 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Dinguana nanu o 144,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Na kengire, ngou na monine Dinguana o ku nemana pa Mukinya wa Sione<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sione po dithzina dimweya dya Yerusalema.</char></note> nanu o 144,000, awa ñoriwire dithzina dyenthzi nedi dya Tata wenthzi pa rupara. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Na yuvire muvumo ou wa tundire ku wiru o ku u vuma eci meyu o ku pupa kokoro karo eci mushika oukuru o mvura. Oo muvumo na yuvire wa cipiturire karo eci anu owangi awa shikire maharepa.<verse eid="REV 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Embire dimbo dyodipe pa rupara ro ngunja no pa rupara ro yumbiwa ine yoiyumi nakuru. Kwithsa oyu wa twethsire ku cirongithsa edyo dimbo shime awo o 144,000 awa paturiwire ku kaye. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Awa wodiyo awa kanine ku cipithsa nambuyama, inene a diyerire ku rara nambuyama. Aa shupwera Dinguana kokuhe oku a thza. Awa wodiyo na paturiwa mu kaci kanu wahe no kwikara mutomwa ou wa ku piwa kwa Nyambi noku kwa Dinguana. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ka kwa waniwire kwangera mu tunwa two, inene ka di no kapongonyi.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tungeru tuhatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ngou na monine kangeru kamweya o ku ka unduka mu wiruwiru. Ka shimbire Muthzimbu Ouwa o diyere ku na tongwera anu o mu kaye, kwanu o mu matunga oahe, mu mishovo, mu manjimi no mu mambunga oahe. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Ka kuererire ko diywi dyodikuru ci: “Mu yape Nyambi karo mu shangare okuru wenthzi! Inene thsikati thsenthzi thsi na kumu thso ku ratura anu. Mu mu rombere aye oyu wa kwamine diwiru, kaye, diwate no manowa o meyu.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Kangeru ko muthsidi ka shupwerire ko kutanga no ku amba ci: “Na u! Na u Babilona Shokuru, oyu naa nwithsa matunga oahe kuanthzi o waine o ruthziho rwenthzi!”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Kangeru ko muthsihatu ka shupwerire oto twidi to kutanga o ku ka kuerera ci: “Munu yomuhe oyu na rombera thsikondwama no thsikupuro thsathso no ku tambura thsitamba thsathso pa rupara nji pa dyoko, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />naye kenge a ku nwa ku waine oanthzi wa Nyambi, oyu naa pingurweriwa mu nganja thzoanthzi wa Nyambi o ku shimbi a rurera. Kenge a ku nyandithsiwa ku mudiro no sulufura pa meho o tungeru totukenu no Dinguana. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Mwithse o kunyandithsiwa kwo kenge wa ku thsima diyere na diyere. Ka ku turumwithsa mutenya nji othsiku pakuninga ci na rombera thsikondwama no thsikupuro thsathso, karo na tambura thsitamba thso dithzina dyathso.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Eyi yaa monithsa ci anua Nyambi aa roera ku cithzua, awa na hengeka eraerera ya Nyambi no ku rurama kwa Yesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Ngou na yuvire diywi ku wiru o ku di amba ci: “O ñore eyi: Akwathsiyauthzi afu awa a fera mwa Fumu ku tunda pano ku twara ku rupara.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">“Yoshemwa dyo i di,” waa amba Mupepo. “Kenge mba turumwithsa kwikwama yo, ekwama yo yoiwa kenge ya ku wa shupwera!”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyanga ko kaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ngou na monine divui dyodikenu, oyu wekarire apo pa divui wa monaharire eci Mwana Munu. Wekarire no mushukwe o gauda ku mutwi wenthzi no cekithsi thzothzitwe mu dyoko dyenthzi. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Kwa keyire kangeru kamweya ku tunda mu Tembere no ku na kuerera koyu wekarire pa divui ci: “O kwamithse cekithsi thzoe honi, inene thsikati thso ku yanga thsi na kumu, edya pa kaye i na pi.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Oya wekarire pa divui ngou a punthzerire cekithsi pa kaye no kaye ka yangiwire.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Kangeru kamweya ka keyire ku tunda mu Tembere ku wiru, nako karo kekarire no cekithsi thzothzitwe.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Karo kangeru kamweya aka kekarire nokoro peuru thzo mudiro, ka keyire ku tunda ku katara no kwithsa ko diywi dyodikuru oyu wa kwatererire cekithsi thzothzitwe ci: “O shimbe cekithsi thzoe thzothzitwe honi o tete ekocera yo veine mu kaye, inene i na pi honi!” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Kangeru ka punthzerire cekithsi thzako mu kaye, ka tetire ekocera yo veine no ku i kuhera mu thsikameno thso waine thsothsikuru thsoanthzi wa Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Eyo ekocera yo veine ya njoviwerire omo mu thsikameno thso waine pora thzo mbongi. Onyinga wa ngongire ku tunda omo mu thsikameno thso waine, wa pupire muendo o ku twethsa ku kwana tunano to 300, nothzungi o ku kuma mu muidi.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Tungeru no makarara o mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ngou na monine mu wiru thsimonithso thsimweya thsothsikuru thso ku komokithsa. Na monine tungeru to mutanu na twidi o ku tu na kwaterera makarara o mutanu na edi o mamaneneno, inene odiyo a ku manenena oanthzi wa Nyambi.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Karo na monine ethsi thsa monaharire eci diwate dyo thsiponi edi di na cipakerera no mudiro. Ngou na monine awa othzire thsiya thsikondwama no thsikupuro thsathso no nomboro thzo dithzina dyathso. Emanine ku nyonga thzo diwate dyo thsiponi o kwa na kwaterera maharepa aa a wa pire Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Embire dimbo dya Mushe aye mupika Nyambi, no dimbo dya Dinguana ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Ekwama yoe ikuru karo yaa komokithsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Fumu Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Makuñwa oe a ku oroka, karo a shemwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Fumu o matunga oahe.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Fumu, edye oyu wa ku kana ku ku yapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">no ku shangara dithzina dyoe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Inene yowe ofoci o mukenu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Matunga oahe kenge a ku keya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">no ku na tongama pa meho oe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">a ku ku rombere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">inene etenda yoe yoiwawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">na i hokoriwa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Munyima thzeyo, na kengire no ku mona ci Tembere mu wiru, athzo tende thza Nyambi thzombangi thza yanthzurukire. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ngou kwa punine oto tungeru to mutanu na twidi mu Tembere, otu twa kwatererire makarara o mutanu na edi. Twa vatire lineni o mukenu o ku rwethzima no ku cianga miya thzo gauda mu miidi thzato. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Thsimweya thso yumbiwa ine yoiyumi ngou thsa pire tungeru to mutanu na twidi turonga to mutanu na twidi to gauda to ku yara oanthzi wa Nyambi oyu yoya diyere na diyere. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Tembere thza yarire mwithse ou wa tundire ku kutethzima kwa Nyambi no kukoro wenthzi. Kwithsa oyu wa twethsire kwingena mu Tembere shime ou a pwire ao makarara o mutanu na edi oto tungeru to mutanu na twidi.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Turonga to mutanu na twidi toanthzi wa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ngou na yuvire diywi dyodikuru edi dya tundererire mu Tembere o ku di amba koto tungeru to mutanu na twidi ci: “Mu thze mu ka pingurwere turonga to mutanu na twidi toanthzi wa Nyambi pa kaye.”<figure style="fig" alt="Bowl being poured out" file="gt00153.tif" size="col" loc="Rev 16:1-2" copy="Gordon" ref="16.1-2">Karonga kaa pingururiwa</figure><verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Kangeru ko kutanga ka thzire no ku ka pingurwera karonga kako pa kaye. Awa ekarire no thsitamba thso thsikondwama no ku rombera thsikupuro thsathso a menine eronda yoimango yo ku kora nene.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Kangeru ko muthsidi ka pingurwerire karonga kako pa diwate. Diwate dya pirukire onyinga eci o munu o kufa. Enu yoihe yoiyumi mu diwate ya fire.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Kangeru ko muthsihatu ka pingurwerire karonga kako pa marware no manowa o meyu, karo ya pirukire onyinga. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Ngou na yuvire kangeru aka ka na mono yo meyu o ku ka amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“O muwawa mu kuratura koe, Owe Shokenu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">oyu diko karo oyu wekarako.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Inene na viithsa onyinga wanuoe owakenu nakwakukethzoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">pano honi o na wa pa onyinga ci a u nwe omu a na roera.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Na yuvire diywi ku tunderera ku katara edi dya ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Ii, Fumu Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">ku ratura koe ku wawa, karo kwa shemwa.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Kangeru ko muthsine ka pingurwerire karonga kako pa diyuwa, diyuwa dya piwire okoro o ku tumeka anu no mudiro. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Anu a pire mukaci koku kupya kokukuru, a yengwerire dithzina dya Nyambi, aye oyu di nokoro pao makarara oahe. Unone a kanine ku cera nji ku shangara Nyambi.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu ka pingurwerire karonga kako pa ngunja thzo thsikondwama, kutumina kwathso kwekarire mu mirema. Anu a cihumine nwaeo mukaci ko kukora. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />A yengwerire Nyambi o diwiru mukaci ko kukora kwo neronda yo, unone a kanine ku cera eyi a kwamine.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu na kofoci ka pingurwerire karonga kako pa Rware roshokuru rwa Yuferati. Rwa pwererire ku roithsera dikuñwa mafumu o ku Muvo. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Na monine mipepo thzothzimango thzihatu ethzi thza monaharire eci mayura, o ku thzi rea mu tunwa to mbarange, thsikondwama no mukwakukethza o mbango. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Ethzo thzodiyo mipepo thzo mathzimu ethzi thzi kwama emonithso yo ku komokithsa karo thzaa thza ku mafumu o kaye kokahe, ku ka wa kungurwera ku mvo mu diyuwa dyoshokuru dya Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Mu mone, naa keya eci mwithzi! Wa thsiyauthzi oyu kuñwera, oyu na cipakera eto yenthzi ci katere a ku ende thsisheshe ku cifithsa honyi.”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ethzo mipepo thzothzimango thza wanekire mafumu pa ndau ethzi thzi nethsiwa mu Thsiheveru ci Hamagedoni.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Kangeru ko muthsitanu na twidi ka pingurwerire karonga kako mu mupepo. Kwa yuvaharire diywi dyodikuru ku tunderera mu Tembere ku tunderera ku ngunja edi dya ambire ci: “Ku na pu.” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Ngou kwekarire kwethsa ko mvura, no kwanduka ko mishika no mivumo. Karo kwekarire kungangama ko kaye kokukuru nene shemwa ko kuninga ci ka kwekarako karo ku tunda apa ombiwerire anu mu kaye. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Thsikuña thsoshokuru thsa citepire epinthzi ihatu nekuña yo matunga ya wire. Nyambi wa vurukire Babilona Shokuru, wa mu nwithsire mu nganja thzo waine oanthzi wenthzi oukuru. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Maongo oahe a umburukire no mikinya thzothzihe thza pwire. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mbwe thzothzikuru thzo ku fota ku kwana oremu o ku twethsa ku kuma pa makiro o makumi ane dimbwe no dimbwe thza wererire anu ku tunda ku wiru. Anu a kuyire Nyambi mukaci kedyo dikarara dyo mbwe, inene nedi dikuru nene.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Diherehere dyoshokuru no thsikondwama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Kamweya ku tungeru to mutanu na twidi tuya twa kwatererire turonga to mutanu na twidi ka keyire ku kwange no ku na ni ambera ci: “O keye na ni ku monithse raturo ethzi thza ku keyera diya diherehere dyoshokuru, diya di nekara po pepi no marware oangi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Mafumu o kaye na tende mirembe nenthzi, nanu o kaye na pende waine o ruthziho rwenthzi.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ako kangeru ka ni shimbire mu Mupepo wa Nyambi no ku ni twara mu dikunguthsitu. Omo na ka monine mbuyama oyu wekarire pa thsikondwama thsothsikihu, ethsi thsa ñoriwire mathzina o ku yengwa perama yoihe. Ethso thsikondwama thsekarire no mitwi thzo mutanu na thzidi no manyia o dikumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Oyo mbuyama wa vatire yo muvara o muhombohombo neyi yoikihu no ku cicakerera epako yo gauda no mawe oakuru mu thsivaka no mapiare. Mu dyoko dyenthzi wa kwatererire nganja thzo gauda ethzi thza yarire omango o kupiterera nenu yo dithziro dyo ruthziho rwenthzi. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Pa rupara rwenthzi kwa ñoriwire dithzina, unone eyi di na amba po diano:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">“Babilona Shokuru,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">Mama o Maherehere</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">Nomango o Kupiterera ouhe o Kaye.”<verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Na monine ci oyo mbuyama shime a pendire onyinga wakwakutawa, onyinga o waya a pire ombangi wa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ou na mu monine na komokire nene. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Kangeru ka nipurire ci: “Ine eyi o na komoka? Kenge ni ku tongonwena eyi di na amba edi diano dyoyu mbuyama nethsi thsikondwama apa a nekara, athso thso mitwi mutanu na thzidi no manyia dikumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Thsiya thsikondwama o na mono shime thsaekarako uno honi ka thsi diko. Unone thsi tamba ku pinduka ku tunda mu dikwina dyo kupira ondanda ku thza ku ka nongithsiwa. Anu o kaye awa kanine ku ñoriwa mathzina o mu Vuka thzo Mwoyo ku tunda ku matatekero o kaye, kenge a ku komoka ou a ku mona karo ethsi thsikondwama, inene shime thsaekarako, unone ka thsi diko, uno honi kenge thsa ku keya.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Eyi yaa fotahara ci munu ekare nonyanyami no kuyuvithsithsa. Mitwi thzo mutanu na thzidi po thza emanena mikinya thzo mutanu na thzidi apa a nekara oyo mbuyama. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Karo thza emanena mafumu o mutanu na edi, o mutanu na u, yumweya kwaa di, yumweya shime ku keya. Ou a ku keya kenge a kwikarako thsikati thsothsipu pohuma. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Thsikondwama ethsi thsekarireko, uno honi ka thsi diko, yodiyo honi fumu o muthsitanu nahatu. Naye wa mu thsipani thsa awo o mutanu na edi, uno honi aa thza ku kunongithsiwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Manyia o dikumi aya o na mono po mafumu o dikumi aa a shime ku tungithsiwa. Uno honi kenge a ku piwa okoro o ku tumina nethso thsikondwama mu thsitunde thsofoci. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Wahe akwa dikumi a di no muanekerero ofoci, kenge a ku pa okoro wo nofumu wo ku thsikondwama. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Wahe kenge a ku rwithsa Dinguana, unone Dinguana kenge a ku wa othza, inene aye po Ñathsire wañathsire, karo Fumu o mafumu. Awa di nenthzi po akwa kwithsiwa, karo akwa ku hanguriwa, karo a rurami.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Kangeru ngou ka ni amberire ci: “Aya meyu o na mono paya di nekara diya diherehere po a emanena mungi wanu ku tunderera mu mambunga oahe, mu mishovo thzothzihe, mu matunga oahe, no mu manjimi oahe. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Thsiya thsikondwama no manyia o dikumi o na mono kenge a ku thzimba diya diherehere no ku di nyanga yoihe eyi a di nayo, ku mu thsia thsisheshe. Kenge a ku dya erama yenthzi no ku mu tumekera mu mudiro. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Inene Nyambi naa paka mu micima thzo ku kwama eanekera yenthzi, kenge a ku tawa ku pa ofumu wo thsiya thsikondwama thsothsikihu, shime maywi a Nyambi ou a ku tenda ku citombora. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Oyu mbuyama o na mono po a emanena thsikuña thsoshokuru ethsi thsi na tumina mafumu o kaye.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuwa kwa Babilona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Munyima thzeyi, na monine kangeru kamweya o ku ka tunda ku wiru. Kekarire nokoro oukuru, kaye kokahe ka munekire mukaci ko kutethzima kwako. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Ka kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“Na u! Na u, Babilona shokuru!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Na piruka diumbo dyo mathzimu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">macihoreko o mipepo thzothzimango,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">macihoreko o mishovo thzothzihe thzenyunyi yo dithziro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">karo macihoreko o mishovo thzothzihe thzekondwama yo dithziro no ku kendiwa.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Inene matunga oahe na a nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ku waine o ruthziho rwenthzi rorukuru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">karo mafumu o kaye na a tende mirembe nenthzi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">Akwamiuro o kaye na fumu mukaci ko ku shima nene kwenthzi ku yoya nawa.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ngou na yuvire diywi dimweya o ku di tunda ku wiru ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Mu tunde ku kwenthzi, amwe mwanuange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ci katere mu cipakerere nenthzi mu thsivi thsenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ci katere mwa ku citapere nenthzi makarara aa a mu keyera.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Inene evi yenthzi po i nongeriwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">thsitungu thso ku ka kuma ku wiru,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:5">Nyambi na vuruka etenda yenthzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">yoimango.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mu mu kwame eci edi na a kwama amweya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">Keyi na a kwama kwamweya, amwe mu i mu kwame rwidi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Eyi na a mi nwithsa yoiruru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">amwe mu mu nwithse yoiruru nene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mu i mu nwithse rwidi.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Eci diya naa cithzineka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">no ku yoya nawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">namwe mu mu nyandithse kengeyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">ci ekare mu makuano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Inene aa ciamberanga ci:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Ni nekara no fumu o mbuyama!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Kadi cingwa no difakathzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">karo mbera ka nikara mu thsidiro.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Mukaci keyo, makarara enthzi, kenge a ku mu wera mu diyuwa dyofoci pohuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kufa, thsidiro no ndombo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kenge a ku tumekeriwa mu mudiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">inene Fumu Nyambi oyu mu ratura, o di nokoro.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Mafumu o kaye aa na a tende nenthzi mirembe no ku cikora ku yoya nawa nene kenge a kwikara mu thsidiro no makuano ou a ku mona mwithse o kupya kwenthzi o ku u thsima. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Kenge a kwimanena kokure, pa ku yapa kunyandithsiwa kwenthzi kokukuru, no ku amba ci: “Mayuwane!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Mayuwane, owe o thsikuña thsoshokuru!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Mayuwane Babilona, thsikuña thsoshokoro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Raturo thza Nyambi thzi na ku keyera mu thsitunde thsofoci.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Akwamiuro o mu kaye kenge a ku mu dira no ku kuana, inene ka kwa kwikara oyu wa ku ura etere yo. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Shime na a uranga gauda o mungi, silivera no mawe oakuru mu thsivaka no mapiare, mambatu oawa, yo muvara o muhombohombo, tererina, eto yoikihu, yo mishovoshovo yo ku yuwa pa mukerete, pa maeo o ndambi, etondo yo ku tura, pa kopa, pa thsifu no pa mawe oakuru mu thsivaka. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Karo naa uranga sinamoni, thsende, insense, mira, furankinsense; edya yo ku cipitura eci waine, maathzi o muywera, oshunga, vuroto, emunanu yo ngombe, mangu, tukambe, matemba, mofoci kengeyo nanu o ku urithsiwa kwikara apika.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Kenge a ku dira ci: “Thsima ethsi no shimanga nene na thsi pu. Rufumo rwoe neyi yo ku roerithsa nayo ya pwa, ko wa ku i wana karo!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Akwamiuro awa na fumena omu mu thsikuña kenge a kwimana kokure, o kwa na yapa mukaci ko kunyandithsiwa kwenthzi kokukuru. Kenge a kwikara mu thsidiro no makuano ci:<verse eid="REV 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />“Mayuwane! Mayuwane! Owe thsikuña thsoshokuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">owe no vatanga eto yoiwa, yo muvara o muhombohombo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">neyi yoikihu no ku yengiwa ko gauda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">o ku rwethzima no mawe oakuru mu thsivaka no mapiare!<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu thsitunde thsofoci roruhe oro rufumo ru nepithsiwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Akuru o mangunde wahe, awa a na endanga ko mangunde navui wahe, nowa a na endithsanga miuro thzo mu diwate wahe kenge a kwimana kokure. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Kenge a ku dira ou a ku mona mwithse o kupya kwenthzi o ku u thsima, kenge a ku amba ci: “Thsipi karo thsikuña ethsi thsekarire thsothsikuru eci ethsi?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Kenge a kwikara pa thsidiro no makuano no ku ciwethsa dikungu ku mitwi no ku dira ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“Mayuwane! Mayuwane! Thsiya thsikuña thsoshokuru kengeya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">Modiyo na fumena akwa mangunde aa a enda mu mawate!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Uno honi mu thsitunde thsofoci pohuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">thsothsihe thsi na pu.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Owe o diwiru, o roere kwipithsiwa kwathso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Namwe mwanua Nyambi mu roere namwe mwa tunganda namwe mwakwakukethza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Inene Nyambi o na mu ratura</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">mukaci keyi naa mi kwama.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Kangeru kokakoro ngou ka yerurire diwe dyodikuru dyo ku kuma podi dyo ku purera vuroto. Ka di kuherire mu diwate no ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Thsikuña thsoshokuru thsa Babilona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">kenge thsa ku kuheriwa pashi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">kokoro o kengeya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">karo mbera ka thsi waniwa karo.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Mivumo thzo maharepa nakwakwimba no tunamutoriro no matorombita</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">mbera ka i yuvahara ku koe karo diyere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Mbera ka kwikara karo akwakukwama owañurungu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">mbera ka waniwa ku koe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Miumba thzakwakutwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">mbera ka thzi yuvahara ku koe karo.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Mumunyi o kambarambara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">mbera ka u muneka ku koe karo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Maywi o thsinyanyu a mukwakuyeka na mwenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">mbera ka a yuvahara ku koe karo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Akwamiuro oe a pitire o mu kaye kokahe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">ko masheno oe o mbango no kwangera matunga oahe!<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Muya mu thsikuña na ku waniwa onyinga wakwakukethza nou wanua Nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">nou wanu wahe awa na paiwa mu kaye.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Membo o thsinyanyu mu wiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Munyima thzeyi, na yuvire eyi ya yuvaharire eci mungi oukuru mu wiru wanu o kwa kuerera ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluya!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ku shangariwe Nyambi.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Kuyoyithsiwa no kutethzima nokoro po ya Nyambi wetu.<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Raturo thzenthzi po thza shemwa karo thza ku oroka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Na a ratura diya diherehere dyoshokuru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">edi na dipithsa kaye ko ruthziho rwadyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Nyambi na a di pa humbithso pa kwipaa apikenthzi.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />A kuererire karo ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Mwithse ou u tunda pa padyo waa thsima diyere na diyere!”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Waya akuru o makumi edi nane no iya yumbiwa yoiyumi ine a tongamine pashi no ku rombera Nyambi, oyu wekarire pa ngunja. A kumbire ci: “Ameni! Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsidika thso wenga wa Dinguana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ngou kwa tundire diywi ku ngunja ku amba ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Mu shangare Nyambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">wetu mwahe amwe mwapikenthzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">amwe mu na mu yapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">ashoonye nowa ashokuru.”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Karo na yuvire eci muvumo o mungi oukuru wanu, nji eci muvumo o meyu oangi aa a pupa, nji eci mushika ou wanduka nene. A ambire ci:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Inene Fumu Nyambi wetu Shokoro Ouhe po aa tumina.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tu nyanyukenu no ku roera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">tu mu penu direma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Inene thsikati thsi na kumu thso wenga wa Dinguana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">mwenga wenthzi na ciroithsera yothsinda.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Naa piwa eto yo lineni yoiwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">yo kurwethzima yoikenu.” (Inene oyo lineni o muwa po a emanena etenda yoiwawa yakwakutawa.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Kangeru ka ni amberire ci: “O ñore eyi: Akwathsiyauthzi awa a na raiwa ku wenga wa Dinguana.” Ka ambire karo ci: “Aa po maywi oshemwa aa a tunda kwa Nyambi.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ngou na tongamine ku mauru ako ku ka rombera. Unone ka kanine ci: “Dyombo, wa ni rombera! No mupika Nyambi eci owe naenthzoe akwakutawa awa a na tanarithsa ombangi wa Yesu. O rombere Nyambi pohuma. Inene mupepo okethzi odiyo u pa ombangi wa Yesu.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oyu wa pahamine pa kakambe kokakenu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Na monine diwiru o ku di na yanthzuruka, akopo ku keya kakambe kokakenu. Oyu wa pahaminepo wethsiwire ci Omururami no Shemwa. Wa raturire no ku rwa kowawa. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Meho enthzi nedi eci mirengi, pa mutwi wenthzi pekarire mishukwe thzothzingi. Wa ñoriwire dithzina edi a kana ku dimuka munu shime aye pohuma. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Thsikoveyo ethsi a vatire thsa cumbwiwire munyinga. Dithzina dyenthzi po nedi Diywi dya Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Akwakurwa o mu wiru a mu shupwerire o kwa na pahama pa tukambe totukenu no ku vata lineni o muwa, yoikenu yo kupira dithziro. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mu kanwa kenthzi kwa tundire mwere outwe o ku rwithsa matunga. Kenge a ku wa tumina no muramu o thsifu, karo kenge a ku a njova eci veine mu thsikameno thso waine thsoanthzi oukuru wa Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Pa thsikoveyo thsenthzi no pa ditumbu kwa ñoriwire edi dithzina ci:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">“Fumu o mafumu no Ñathsire wañathsire.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ngou na monine kangeru aka kemanine mu diyuwa aka ka kumbire ko diywi dyodikuru enyunyi yoihe eyi ya undukire mu wiruwiru ci: “Mu keye mu ciwane pofoci pa thsidika thsothsikuru ethsi a na kwama Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Na mu dye nyama thzo mafumu, aendithsi no mashwarare, nyama thzo tukambe nothzi thzowa a na pahamapo, nyama thzanu wahe, apika nakwakurukuruka, ashokuru nowa ashoonye!”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ngou na monine thsiya thsikondwama no mafumu o kaye no mashwarare o o kwa na ciwana pofoci ku rwithsa oyu wa pahamine pa kakambe nakwakurwenthzi. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Unone ethso thsikondwama thsa kwatiwire, mofoci kengeyo no mukwakukethza o mbango oyu wa kwamine emonithso yo ku komokithsa mu dithzina dyathso. Keyo emonithso wangerire awa ekarire no thsitamba thsethso thsikondwama nowa a romberire thsikupuro thsathso. Thsikondwama noyo mukwakukethza o mbango momu widi wo a kuheriwire o kwa di oyumi mu diviya dyo mudiro o ku yuuma no sulufura. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Amweya wahe a paiwire ko uya mwere outwe uya wa tundire mu kanwa koya wa pahamine pa kakambe. Enyunyi yoihe yekutire nyama thzo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Satana a angiwa myaka thzo kakore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ngou na monine kangeru o ku ka tunda mu wiru, o ku ka na shimbi dipao dyo ku dikwina dyo kupira ondanda, karo ka kwatererire didyenge dyodikuru mu dyoko dyako. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ka kwatire oya mbarange, diya diyoka dyo kare, aye shamaonga nji Satana no ku mwanga no madyenge myaka thzo kakore. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Ka mu kuherire mu dikwina dyo kupira ondanda, ka vukireko no ku vivako ci Satana katere a kwangere matunga karo, shime ou thza ku pwa ethzo myaka thzo kakore. Munyima thzeyo, aa roera ku puturiwa thsikati thsothsipu.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Na monine mangunja, awa ekarirepo a piwire okoro o ku ratura. Karo na monine myoyo thzowa a tetiwire mitwi mukaci kombangi wa Yesu no ku rongithsa diywi dya Nyambi. Ka romberire thsikondwama nji thsikupuro thsathso, karo ka tamburire thsitamba thsathso pa rupara nji pa moko. A yoyire karo no ku na tumina na Krisitu myaka thzo kakore.<verse eid="REV 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Oku kodiyo ku pinduka kwafu ko kutanga. (Uno honi amweya afu ka pindukire kwafu shime ou thza pwire ethzo myaka thzo kakore). <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Akwathsiyauthzi, karo akenu awa ku waniwa mu ku pinduka kwafu ko kutanga. Kufa ko muthsidi ka ku di nokoro peuru thzo, unone kenge a kwikara mapurisita a Nyambi na Krisitu, karo kenge a ku tumina nenthzi myaka thzo kakore.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuothziwa kwa Satana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ou thza ku pwa ethzo myaka thzo kakore, Satana kenge a ku punithsiwa mu kamenga kenthzi. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Kenge a ku thza ku kangera matunga mu mambango ane o kaye, Gogo na Magogo, no ku ka waneka anu ku ka rwa. Taro thzo po eci ruheke ro pa diya dyo diwate. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />A caurire no ku ciyamba kaye kokahe no ku paka mu kaci thsirombo thsanua Nyambi no thsikuña thso ku shimiwa. Unone mudiro wa tundire ku wiru no ku na wa ñotora.<verse eid="REV 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Ngou shamaonga oyu wa wangerire a konthzeriwire mu diviya dyo mudiro o sulufura, omu thsa kuheriwire thsiya thsikondwama noya mukwakukethza o mbango. Kenge a ku nyandithsiwa mutenya nothsiku diyere na diyere.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raturo thzo mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Na monine ngunja thzothzikuru thzothzikenu noyu wekarirepo. Kaye no diwiru ya cirire pa meho enthzi, ka ya monaharire karo. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ngou na monine afu, owakuru nowa owaonye o kwa nemana pa rupara ro ngunja thza Nyambi. Mavuka a thsikuriwire. Ngou kwa thsikuriwire vuka thzimweya, athzo Vuka thzo Mwoyo. Afu a raturiwire kokuthza keyi ya ñoriwire mu mavuka, eyi a kwamine. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Diwate dya huthsire afu awa ekariremo, no kufa no mararo nayo ya huthsire afu. Wahe a raturiwire kekwama yo. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ngou honi kufa no mararo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po Hadesi ku amba Ndau Thzafu. </char></note> ya kuheriwire mu diviya dyo mudiro. Edi diviya dyo mudiro po kufa ko muthsidi. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Yomuhe oyu wa waniwire ci ka a ñoriwire mu vuka thzo mwoyo wa kuheriwire mu diviya dyo mudiro.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Diwiru dyodipe no kaye kokape</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ngou na monine diwiru dyodipe no kaye kokape, inene diwiru dyo kutanga no kaye ko kutanga ya pwire, karo ka kwekarire karo diwate. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Na monine Thsikuña Thsoshokenu, aye Yerusalema omupe, o ku shurumuka ku tunda mu wiru kwa Nyambi, o ku na roithsiwa nawa no ku yengiwera munuwenthzi eci mwenga.<verse eid="REV 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Na yuvire diywi dyodikuru ku tunderera ku ngunja ci: “O mone, ndau omu a tunga Nyambi mu kaci kanuenthzi thzi di honi, karo kenge a ku yoyano. Kenge a kwikarano, karo kenge a kwikara anuenthzi, karo aye Nyambi kenge a kwikara Nyambi wo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Kenge a ku porora mihothzi thzothzihe ku meho o. Ka kwa kwikara kufa nji thsidiro nji kudira nji kukora, inene enu yo kare i na pu.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Oyu wekarire pa ngunja wa ambire ci: “Mu mone, naa kwama enu yoihe ope!” Ngou a ambire ci: “O ñore eyi, inene aa maywi po aa kuruperiwa karo a shemwa.”<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Wa ni amberire ci: “Ku na pu. Yame no Alufa no Omega, Matatekero no Mamaneneno. Oyu na fu dinotwa kenge na ku mu pa meyu aa a tunda mu dinowa dyo mwoyo o ku piwa kengekenge. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Wahe awa a ku othza kenge a ku tambura yoihe eyi, kenge na kwikara Nyambi wo, nawo kenge a kwikara anange. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Uno honi owawowa, akwakukana ku tawa, owamango, epaanu, o ruthziho, arothzi, akwakurombera ekupuro nakwakwangera wahe, awo kenge mba konthzeriwa mu diviya edi di yuuma mudiro no sulufura. Oku kodiyo kufa ko muthsidi.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Kamweya ko tuya tungeru to mutanu na twidi, tuya twa kwatererire turonga to mutanu na twidi to ku yara to makarara o mutanu naedi o mamaneneno, ka keyire no ku na ni ambera ci: “O keye, kenge na ni ku monithsa mwenga, munu wa Dinguana.”<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Ngou ka ni shimbire mu Mupepo ku thza ku mukinya oukuru oure, ka ka ni monithsire Thsikuña thso Shokenu aye Yerusalema, o ku tunda mu wiru kwa Nyambi. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Thsa tethzimine ko kutethzima kwa Nyambi. Thsa tethzimine eci diwe dyodikuru mu thsivaka, eci jasipere no ku vyakima eci kirisitale. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Thsekarire no dimota dyodikuru dyodire no mathsero o dikumi na edi aa a nyungiwire ku tungeru to dikumi na twidi. Apo pa mathsero pa ñoriwire mathzina o mikuta thzo dikumi na thzidi thza Isiraele. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kwekarire mathsero ahatu ku muvo, ahatu ku wiko, ahatu ku mboera no a ahatu ku mutoko. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Edyo dimota dyethso thsikuña dya umbiwire pa mishisho thzo mawe thzo dikumi na thzidi, apo pa mishisho pa ñoriwire mathzina o tunganda to dikumi na twidi twa Dinguana.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ako kangeru ka ambire nange kekarire no thsianekethzithso thso gauda thso ku anekethzithsa ethso thsikuña, mathsero athso no dimota dyathso. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ethso thsikuña thsa cipiturire mu ure no mu wipi, ore no wipi mofoci. Wa anekethzire ethso thsikuña ko thsianekethzithso thsenthzi, wa wanine unaure wadyo, wipi wadyo nore wadyo nedi tunano to 2,200. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Kangeru ka anekethzire karo dimota dyathso, kwa wanaharire ci mucika wadyo nedi mamita o ku twethsa ku kwana 65<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu Thsigerike po kwaa ñoriwa makubiti o 144.</char></note> kokuthza ko muanekethzithso wanu ou ka kwamithsire kangeru.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Edyo dimota shime dya kwamiwire pa mawe o jasipere, athso thsikuña shime thsa umbiwire ko gauda shemwa oyu weerire eci divotoro. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Mushisho odyo dimota dyethso thsikuña shime wa yengiwire no mawe oakuru mu thsivaka o dikumi na edi. Mushisho o kutanga nedi jasipere, o muthsidi nedi safire, o muthsihatu nedi kalisedo, o muthsine nedi emaraludi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />o muthsitanu nedi saridonikisi, o muthsitanu na ofoci nedi karinelia, o muthsitanu na thzidi nedi kirisolite, o muthsitanu na thzihatu nedi berileo, o muthsitanu na thzine nedi topazi, o mudikumi nedi kirisoparase, o mudikumi na ofoci nedi jasinito, o mudikumi na thzidi nedi ametisito.<verse eid="REV 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Ao mathsero o dikumi na edi nedi mapiare o dikumi na edi, thsero no thsero shime thza kwamiwire pa piare thzofoci. Mukwakwa omo mu thsikuña shime wa kwamiwire pa gauda shemwa, oyu weerire eci divotoro.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Ka na monine Tembere omo mu thsikuña, inene Fumu Nyambi Shokoro Ouhe na Dinguana po wodiyo a Tembere thzathso. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Ethso thsikuña ka kwa fotaharire ci shime kwikare diyuwa nji ngonda ku thsi munekera, inene kutethzima kwa Nyambi kwa thsi pire mwethzi, karo Dinguana yodiyo kambarambara kathso. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Matunga kenge a ku enda mu mwethzi wathso, mafumu o kaye kenge a ku reta rufumo rwo omo mu thsikuña. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Mathsero othso thsikuña a ku yanthzuruka mayuwa oahe. Ka a ku yanthzeriwa, inene mbera ka mwikara othsiku omo.<verse eid="REV 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Matunga oahe kenge a ku reta kutethzima kwao no direma dyao kwethso thsikuña. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Kwithsa thso dithziro ethsi mba thsingenamo omo mu thsikuña, nji munu oyu na a kwama omango o kupiterera nji kwangera. Kenge mba kwingena pohuma awa ñoriwa mu Vuka thzo Mwoyo thza Dinguana.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TC, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Rware ro Mwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Kangeru ngou ka ni monithsire aro rware ro meyu o mwoyo. Rwa tethzimine tethzi eci kirisitale, o ku ru pupa ku tunda ku ngunja thza Nyambi nethzi thza Dinguana. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Rwa urumukire ku pupa pa kaci ko mukwakwa oshokuru o mu thsikuña. Mu thsambwedi no mu thsambwedi thzoro rware kwekarire athso thsitondo thso mwoyo, ethsi thsemine ima yo dikumi na idi ngonda no ngonda. Mamuna athso shime a kwamithsiwire ku porithsa matunga.<verse eid="REV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Mbera ka mwikara thso ku kutiwa, unone ngunja thza Nyambi nethzi thza Dinguana kenge ya kwikaramo, apikenthzi kenge mba mu kwamena. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Kenge mba mona rupara rwenthzi, kenge mba ñoriwa dithzina dyenthzi pa rupara. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Ka mba mwikara karo othsiku, mbera ka mba foto kambarambara nji diyuwa ku wa munekera, inene Fumu Nyambi kenge a ku wa munekera, karo kenge mba tumina diyere na diyere.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeya kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kangeru ngou ka ni amberire ci: “Aa maywi po aa kuruperiwa, karo a shemwa. Fumu Nyambi oyu na panga akwakukethza Mupepo wenthzi, na a tumu kangeru kenthzi ku monithsa apikenthzi enu eyi i na roera ku tendahara popano.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“O mone, popano naa keya! Wa thsiyauthzi o ku hengeka maywi okethzi aa a di omu mu vuka.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ame no Johani yame na yuvire no ku mona eyi enu eyi. Ou na i yuvire no ku i mona, na furumanine ku rombera ku mauru o kangeru aka ka i ni monithsire. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Unone ka ni amberire ci: “Dyombo, wa ni rombera! Ame po no mupika Nyambi eci edi o di owe naenthzoe akwakukethza nowa a na hengeka aa maywi othzi vuka. O rombere Nyambi pohuma!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ngou ka ni amberire ci: “Aa maywi okethzi a di omu mu vuka wa a horeka, inene thsikati thso ku tendahara eyi pepi thsi di. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Oyu wipithsa a tware ku rupara ku tenda omango, o dithziro a tware ku rupara ku tenda yo dithziro, o muwawa a tware rupara ku tenda owawa, o mukenu a tware ku rupara kwikara o mukenu.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yesu wa ambire ci: “O mone, naa keya popano. Muyambo wange po nange u di, kenge na ku na pa munu no munu kokuthza kekwama yo. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Yame no Alufa no Omega, o Kutanga no Mahurerero, Matatekero no Mamaneneno.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Akwathsiyauthzi awa a yoa ekoveyo yo, ci nga a kwikare noroero o kwingena mu mathsero o thsikuña no ku dya ku ima yo thsitondo thso mwoyo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Pora kenge kwa ku thsiara mbwa, arothzi, akwaruthziho, epaanu, akwakurombera ekupuro nowa wahe awa a na shimi ku yoya mwoyo o kwangera.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Ame no Yesu, ni na tumu kangeru kange ku na mi pa ou ombangi ku makereke. Yame no Ditunderero no Mwanahoka shokuru wa Davida, yame no Dirungwe edi di muneka.<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Mupepo na mwenga aa amba ci: “O keye!” Oyu na yuvu eyo yomuhe naye a ambe ci: “O keye!” Yomuhe oyu na fu dinotwa a keye, yomuhe oyu na shimi a nwe ku meyu o mwoyo ko kupira ku patara.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Naa nomenithsa wahe awa a na yuvu maywi okethzi aa a na ñoriwa omu mu vuka: Ngeci munu ayepo vungithsa ngara thsinu kweyi i na ñoriwa omu, Nyambi kenge a ku vungithsera oyo munu makarara aa a na ambiwa omu mu vuka. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Karo ngeci munu aa tundithsa ngara diywi mwethzi vuka thzokethzi, Nyambi kenge a ku mu nyanga eyi a na roera ku eriwa ku ima yo thsitondo thso mwoyo noku thsikuña thso shokenu thsa Yerusalema, eyi i na ñoriwa omu mu vuka.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Oyu pa ombangi weyi enu eyi yoihe a amba ci: “Ii, naa keya popano!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Yoshemwa! O keye, Fumu Yesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Thsihemo thsa Fumu Yesu thsikare nanua Nyambi wahe. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>